---
permalink: /en/tour/recorrido/
title: "Route & itinerary"
description: "The Palomino Islands tour route: La Punta, El Camotal, San Lorenzo, El Frontón, Cavinzas and Palomino. History and wildlife at every stop."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/en/tour/">The Tour</a><span>›</span> Route</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Route</p>
    <h1>Six stops, one unforgettable voyage</h1>
    <p class="lead">Each departure crosses Callao bay — its history and its wildlife — all the way to the Palomino Islands.</p>
    <div class="asset-pending" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">{{ t.assetPending }} · route map (to be created from the verified stops)</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid cols-2">
      {% for stop in site.route %}
      <article class="card reveal"><div class="card__body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Stop {{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3>{{ stop.en }}</h3>
        <p>{{ stop.desc_en }}</p>
      </div></article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <h3>Duration & logistics</h3>
      <p>Approximate duration: 3–4 hours. Departures are <strong>by reservation</strong> (no fixed schedule). The exact boarding address is shared once your booking is confirmed.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:var(--space-2)"><span class="pending">{{ t.pending }} — boarding address and booking lead time (B5, B10)</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
